{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdZ1i7EdA6TSAepWqpcn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"NVIDIA reports that Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe processed 100 hours of audio in under three minutes on a single RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Server Edition GPU. That works out to more than 2,000 times faster than real time. The conditions matter. The run used the forthcoming NVFP4 quantized version rather than the checkpoint available now, and it was measured on 30-second clips at high concurrency. The result describes batch transcription of a large archive, and it says little about the latency of a single request.\n\nThe speed follows from the architecture. A speech encoder feeds a hybrid Mamba-Transformer mixture-of-experts language model with 30B parameters, of which about 4B are active per token. On the Artificial Analysis Speech-to-Text Leaderboard, which ranks models independently, it ties for first among open-weight models at 2.8% AA-WER, against 24B active parameters for the model it ties. On AA-AgentTalk, a held-out voice-agent speech set that makes up half of the AA-WER index, it scores 1.8% against 2.3% for the next-best open-weight model. Artificial Analysis also places it ahead of several widely used proprietary speech APIs on its all-model chart.\n\nThe deployment options are broad. The available checkpoint can be served with vLLM or SGLang-Omni, run locally with NeMo-Speech.cpp, or reached through hosted endpoints from Baseten, DeepInfra and Simplismart. One limit applies to all of them: Transcribe is built for recorded audio, not live streaming. For a team with a backlog of recordings, such as call archives or recorded classes, the efficiency figures are relevant. A team that needs captions during a live conversation would need to look elsewhere."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1092,"cache_read_input_tokens":9994,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1092},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36151e93-a157-48a1-8c2d-a29815113b4f","uuid":"b8f16576-14e3-4504-bff4-ec3daf0d4a66","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:31:11.763Z","request_id":"req_011CgdZ1huamE6Eztfd58qKP"}
